  "body": "LOT 1 - SOLD\r\nLOT 2 - SOLD\r\nLOT 3 - SOLD \r\nLOT 4 - SOLD\r\nLOT 5 - SOLD\r\nLOT 6 - SOLD \r\nLOT 6B - AVAILABLE\r\n\r\nAn exceptional opportunity to secure a stylish home in the heart of Milford - one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nThis boutique development offers several properties with a range of floor plans designed to suit different lifestyles and families.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer looking to get into a premium suburb, an investor seeking strong rental appeal, or simply wanting easy-care living close to everything - these homes are a must-see.\r\n\r\n16 Dallinghoe Crescent, Milford\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned within walking distance to cafes, restaurants, supermarkets, schools, and public transport, with Milford Beach just minutes \r\naway.\r\n\r\nForget the car - everything you need is right at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n* Double Westlake School Zone\r\n*  Milford & Takapuna Beaches Nearby - No need for a pool\r\n*  Walk to Shops, Cafes & Transport\r\n*  Modern, Low-Maintenance Living\r\n*  Ideal Lock-Up-and-Leave Lifestyle\r\n* Excellent Investment Opportunity\r\n\r\nWith stylish finishes, functional layouts, and move-in-ready convenience, these homes represent exceptional value in a tightly held location.\r\n\r\n\r\nBonus!!!!:\r\n\r\nEnjoy 2 Years FREE Body Corporate Fees (cashback on settlement) \r\n\r\nContact us today for more information or to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\n*Images have been virtually staged\r\n\r\n16E Dallinghoe Crescent, Milford\r\nhttp://rwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG34660",
